{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "SAMLTrust",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {
        "Federated": "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:saml-provider/MyCompany"
      },
      "Action": "sts:AssumeRoleWithSAML"
    }
  ]
}

Permissions policy:

{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "ReadOnlyAccess",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "ec2:Describe*",
        "s3:ListAllMyBuckets",
        "s3:GetBucketLocation"
      ],
      "Resource": "*"
    }
  ]
}

Flow:

Employee
   ↓
Corporate Identity Provider
   ↓
SAML Assertion
   ↓
AWS STS
   ↓
IAM Role
   ↓
AWS Console

Example:

Microsoft Entra ID
        ↓
      SAML
        ↓
       AWS
        ↓
ReadOnlyRole

Use when: enterprise employees authenticate through a corporate identity provider using SAML federation.